  "text": "NICE Guideline CG150: Headaches in Over 12s Diagnosis and Management | Publisher: National\nMedication-Overuse Headache Prevention\nFrequent use of acute pain medications can cause medication-overuse\nheadache. Prevention Advice: - Track pain medication frequency in a\nheadache diary. - Consult a doctor if acute treatments are needed more\nthan twice a week.\nPage 4 of 4 | Official Educational Resource",
